   "text": "Heriot-Watt University Malaysia - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nHeriot-Watt University Malaysia\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nHeriot-Watt University Malaysia's purpose-built campus opened in Putrajaya in September 2014, £35 million was invested in the Malaysian campus, which is the first 'green campus' in the country. It is situated in a lakeside location of 4.8 acres offering undergraduate as well as master's degree.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n18/06/2026 07:24\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n10/04/2026 07:01\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nMalaysia\nYearly Fees\nMax: MYR 75,000.00\nMin: MYR 41,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n20%\n700 of 3,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2012\nCampus(es)\nPutrajaya\nCountry\nMalaysia\nExcluded Countries\nUnited States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n16/01/2023\nContract End Date\n16/01/2026\nOverride Till Contract End Date\n31/08/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nExpired\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mc1LLr3BipM\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
